  "description": "After inheriting a casino hotel, several ships, and an old aquarium, a wealthy man travels to the American West to manage his new properties. There, he meets a mysterious bartender known for casual encounters. Intrigued by his striking appearance and the rumors surrounding him, he takes him back to his hotel room. But when their night takes an unexpected turn, he ends up comforting the tearful man before falling asleep beside him. By morning, his mysterious companion has vanished, leaving him bewildered and determined to understand what happened.\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/eternalsea)",
